# Editor gizmo QA (just qa-editor Tests/QA/editor-gizmos.qa): the transform gizmo in each mode, idle and dragging, the
# scene icons and the grid. Review the PNGs in artifacts/qa-editor.
wait 40
capture g00-scene
select Ring/Column
key F
wait 8
capture g01-translate
gizmo-drag x 120 0 60 hold
wait 30
capture g02-translate-drag
mouse-up
wait 5
key Z cmd
key E
wait 3
capture g03-rotate
gizmo-drag y 80 40 60 hold
wait 40
capture g04-rotate-drag
mouse-up
wait 5
key Z cmd
key R
wait 3
capture g05-scale
key W
move 800 500
wheel -6
wait 5
capture g06-zoomed-out
select Lights/WarmSpot
wait 3
capture g07-spot-selected
quit
